&lt;strong&gt;Current Status:&lt;/strong&gt; 38 containers sent out to Site-██ for consumption, remaining containers in cold storage.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Can we find a way to get more of these? They taste amazing! &amp;#8212;Dr. Jones&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
