&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;Updates&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;Project&amp;nbsp;Farii&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;Showing&amp;nbsp;updates...&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;material-box&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A meta-analysis conducted by the Memetic and Infohazards Division showed that subjects from younger demographics had lower rates of fatality compared to to the average.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cross-referencing with historical data revealed that individuals between the ages of 7 - 16 are at their most flexible in terms of memetic processing, and would be significantly more suited for Project Farii - predicting a drop in the fatality rate to 12%.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In order to perform its duty, the Foundation must be at the forefront in every field, anomalous ones included. To that end, it is of utmost importance that the Foundation establish a process of imparting knowledge free from the constraints of experience or time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The supply of subjects within the suitable age range will be handled by Logistics and Human Resources. With these conditions, we hereby authorize the continuation of Project Farii.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ll be expecting good results, Desigr. Crowsworth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- O5 Council&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;material-box&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 16px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;tt&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:125%;&quot;&gt;Amendments to PROJECT FARII&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In conjunction with new adaptations of the Foundation Ascension Program, Project Farii has been modified to contain three additional steps:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates of Foundation Ascension Program will undergo intensive amnestics treatment, serving twofold purposes: maximizing available memory capacity, and standardizing subjects&#039; condition in preparation for the implant stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undesirable personality traits are to be overwritten using modified outputs of &lt;em&gt;Project Aletheia&lt;/em&gt; to minimize chances of implant failure, as well as increasing potential productivity level upon the completion of the program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In the events of difficulty when establishing false history and memory under Foundation employment, &lt;em&gt;Project Kallinikos&lt;/em&gt; is to be deployed, pending O5 approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is expected that with the success of Farii, Foundation workforce will have a substantial increase of up to 1000 new high-skill employees a year.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The future of the Foundation will be secured.&lt;/p&gt;
