&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;like my stuff?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;aw shucks, thanks. i&#039;m open for collabs almost all the time, so just hit me up. it helps if you have an idea though, so don&#039;t just come up to me asking to write.&lt;/p&gt;
